sequenceDiagram
    participant Requester as Requesting EHR<br/>(Country B)
    participant NationalB as National infrastructure<br/>(Country B)
    participant NCPB as Requesting NCP<br/>(Country B)
    participant NCPA as Responding NCP<br/>(Country A)
    participant NationalA as National infrastructure<br/>(Country A)
    participant EHR as Data-holding EHR<br/>(Country A)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Requester,NationalB: This IG
    Requester->>NationalB: Query patient data
    NationalB->>NCPB: Query
    NCPB->>NCPA: Query
    NCPA->>NationalA: Query
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over NationalA,EHR: This IG
    NationalA->>EHR: Query
    EHR-->>NationalA: Patient data
    end
    NationalA-->>NCPA: Patient data
    NCPA-->>NCPB: Patient data
    NCPB-->>NationalB: Patient data
    NationalB-->>Requester: Patient data
    end
